# Example robots.txt for NADA. Copy to robots.txt in the web root (the folder that serves https://your-host/), or
# merge these lines into the robots.txt you already have there. robots.txt is only read at the root of the host.

User-agent: *
# Catalog search pages past the numbered pages are reached with a cursor (…&cursor=…): an endless chain of URLs that
# crawlers should not follow. Numbered pages (page=2, page=3, …) stay crawlable.
Disallow: /*cursor=
